@startuml
title S2 - Mengerjakan Simulasi & Menerima Feedback

actor "Job Seeker" as U
participant "UI" as UI
participant "Simulation" as SIM
participant "Feedback & Progress" as FP
database "Database" as DB

U -> UI: Isi jawaban, klik "Kirim"
UI -> SIM: submitAnswers(userId, answers)

alt Ada jawaban kosong
  SIM --> UI: error validasi
  UI --> U: "Semua task wajib diisi"
else Semua terisi
  SIM -> SIM: evaluate_simulation(correct, total)
  SIM -> FP: saveResult(userId, score, status)
  FP -> DB: simpan hasil
  DB --> FP: OK
  FP --> SIM: feedback sesuai status
  SIM --> UI: skor + status + feedback
  UI --> U: Tampilkan hasil
end
@enduml
